[background arg="res://img/point_and_click/backgrounds/Game Jam 2026 Doctor Background 1.png" fade="0.0"]
join Doctor center
label doctor_greeting
Doctor: "Ohoho, a customer.\
Hale and hearty by the looks of it, heehee."
- "I'd like to buy some medicine." | [if {items.revive} == false]
	Doctor: "You mean my glorious, delicious, tinctures?\
	Why, of course you can!"
	Doctor: "They just might save your life, heehee."
	Doctor: "But I don't give them out for free.\
	That'll be 2 gold."
	- Purchase [gain 1 revive] | [if {gold} >= 2.0]
		set {items.revive} = true
		set {gold} -= 2.0
		You now have one revive.
		jump doctor_greeting
	- "Nevermind."
		Doctor: "Hmmm... Your loss."
		jump doctor_greeting
- "Goblins are attacking the town at nightfall." | [if {recruitment.doctor_recruited} == false]
	Doomsayer: "I'm planning to gather people at the church to defend the village.\
	Will you join me?"
	Doctor: "Hmmm...\
	Goblins you say?"
	Doctor: "They do have such useful organs, heehee."
	Doctor: "I wish I could help, but...\
	I'm running low on supplies to make more tinctures.\
	There wouldn't be enough to go around."
	Doctor: "Ohoho, but...\
	I could join you if you gathered some herbs for me first."
	- Gather herbs [lose 3 hours, or lose 2 hours with dodge] | [if {hours} >= 3.0]
		if {items.dodge} == false:
			set {recruitment.doctor_recruited} = true
			set {hours} -= 3.0
			set {recruitment.recruitees} += 1.0
			The doctor describes the herbs needed. You spend hours wandering around the woods, gathering as much as you can find.
			You have a harrowing experience with hidden goblin trap, and end up dropping much of what you've already gathered. It takes you a while to pick it all back up.
			You bring the herbs to him after three hours, and he disappears into the back room. You hear the sounds of glass vials clinking and the occasional mad chuckle.
			jump doctor_greeting
		elif {items.dodge} == true:
			set {recruitment.doctor_recruited} = true
			set {hours} -= 2.0
			set {recruitment.recruitees} += 1.0
			The doctor describes the herbs needed. You spend hours wandering around the woods, gathering as much as you can find.
			You just barely avoid a hidden goblin trap. You stand still for a moment, heart beating wildly, and then decide it's probably a good time to go back...
			You bring the herbs to him after two hours, and he disappears into the back room. You hear the sounds of glass vials clinking and the occasional mad chuckle.
			jump doctor_greeting
	- "Maybe later."
		jump doctor_greeting
- Return to the town square
	leave Doctor
	jump village/square